1. The main issue is in the loop invariant: `invariant foundDecimal ==> digitsAfterDecimal == (ix - (iy when foundDecimal))` - this syntax is invalid in Dafny.
2. The instructions suggest a different approach with `foundDecimal := (s[ix] == '.') numCharsAfterDecimal := 0;` which has syntax errors.
